    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddc0 <strong>HAVE YOU WISHLISTED YET?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Because every second counts \u2014 and this rat needs your support to save his family!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc2d\ud83d\udca5 SAVE YOUR FAMILY BEFORE IT'S TOO LATE! \ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc2d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516800/extras/530303fe0b23ceeda40491beb47ca684.poster.avif?t=1755290717\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516800/extras/530303fe0b23ceeda40491beb47ca684.webm?t=1755290717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516800/extras/530303fe0b23ceeda40491beb47ca684.mp4?t=1755290717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 A MISSILE IS COMING! YOUR CHILDREN ARE TRAPPED! YOU HAVE SECONDS TO SAVE THEM!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516800/extras/eaef5c360b9f5041d59cdb63ef1b22ed.poster.avif?t=1755290717\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516800/extras/eaef5c360b9f5041d59cdb63ef1b22ed.webm?t=1755290717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516800/extras/eaef5c360b9f5041d59cdb63ef1b22ed.mp4?t=1755290717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a desperate <strong>rat father</strong> racing against time to save your children from a <strong>40-floor building</strong> before everything goes up in flames!</p><ul class=\